# Usage example 1 — question intent as a declarative proposition.
# Design inspired by QA2D's question-to-proposition idea; authored here, no
# external rows copied. Domain: employment and roles (not kinship).
#
# Message: "Who works at North Lab?" The model writes the question as strings;
# the host links "works at" and "North Lab" to its lexicon and compiles
# retrieval, reasoning and rendering into an inspectable circuit.
@question query
  select ?who
  where match
    relation "works at"
    role subject ?who
    role object "North Lab"
    polarity affirmed
  end
